INPUT:
  - quantity (int)

PROCESSING:
  - Get widget quantity from user.
  - Evaluate pricing tiers with conditional logic (if/elif/else):
      - If quantity > 10000 -> price = $10
      - If 5000 to 10000   -> price = $20
      - If below 5000      -> price = $30
  - Calculate extended price = quantity * price
  - Calculate sales tax = extended price * 0.07
  - Calculate total = extended price + tax

OUTPUT:
  - extended_price (float) [Decimals aligned]
  - tax_amount (float)     [Decimals aligned]
  - total_cost (float)     [Decimals aligned]
